/><zone xml:id="m-b0d21334-f332-431b-ac4d-3dd51062455a" ulx="47" uly="787" lrx="917" lry="833" /><zone xml:id="m-1a20de3a-f2d6-4193-bdc4-7b7b8192092f" ulx="75" uly="824" lrx="639" lry="860" /><zone xml:id="m-3b641da3-39cc-4ab7-a76f-3120b2644dd3" ulx="432" uly="890" lrx="560" lry="926" /><zone xml:id="m-a4683b04-7e00-4deb-88c7-e061c34fff0c" ulx="74" uly="936" lrx="422" lry="972" /><zone xml:id="m-5eafc4e9-0e7a-4825-9e23-9d0ca79977a5" ulx="435" uly="968" lrx="547" lry="1003" /><zone xml:id="m-3eb8bf58-f9b7-4b91-8201-93bba5175940" ulx="87" uly="1002" lrx="940" lry="1041" /><zone xml:id="m-54931dd6-2e88-4be1-a5b6-591b582e5a21" ulx="49" uly="1035" lrx="937" lry="1073" /><zone xml:id="m-8591b87d-85a8-4236-831d-362b93c8d7a3" ulx="48" uly="1065" lrx="801" lry="1099" /><zone xml:id="m-ab3fc215-5de3-44c9-aaa3-4a02e9d4a318" ulx="53" uly="1092" lrx="498" lry="1125" /><zone xml:id="m-6f35550f-2891-42fa-843c-a17fb2b75102" ulx="73" uly="1130" lrx="596" lry="1171" /><zone xml:id="m-8420cdcf-097a-4e3f-b052-e02e8bda285f" ulx="72" uly="1168" lrx="941" lry="1211" /><zone xml:id="m-c2630f8f-09de-4772-ad4f-ac5bff9a59be" ulx="47" uly="1195" lrx="257" lry="1240" /><zone xml:id="m-caddcc4b-f8b8-4a4b-8e17-d39cc688ddf5" ulx="50" uly="1256" lrx="942" lry="1303" /><zone xml:id="m-5f487101-e518-4e95-8e41-18930bb92c45" ulx="66" uly="1308" lrx="943" lry="1349" /><zone xml:id="m-529e18a7-00e1-4957-af3b-98311419b569" ulx="54" uly="1339" lrx="943" lry="1381" /><zone xml:id="m-c2d1723f-0777-4bc2-b34e-4b5e6a337fd3" ulx="503" uly="1366" lrx="942" lry="1405" /><zone xml:id="m-f57a8271-a8e3-4f52-8989-1e78d1d261bb" ulx="50" uly="1373" lrx="494" lry="1402" /><zone xml:id="m-3fe968be-47b1-4aa1-9213-2d093a458851" ulx="503" uly="1395" lrx="943" lry="1431" /><zone xml:id="m-bbbc62d0-1823-441a-abdd-92e085c7dcc6" ulx="50" uly="1396" lrx="492" lry="1437" /><zone xml:id="m-ba395343-803a-406f-8ca9-7e26366e0ef5" ulx="502" uly="1421" lrx="944" lry="1458" /><zone xml:id="m-b46274ed-eb36-4847-b003-ce59fd4ffea9" ulx="51" uly="1426" lrx="493" lry="1463" /><zone xml:id="m-a2a9f186-c654-474e-8c49-dea89a17ea70" ulx="50" uly="1453" lrx="494" lry="1487" /><zone xml:id="m-429e239b-c3af-450b-8c4e-efd780b29226" ulx="501" uly="1453" lrx="944" lry="1485" /><zone xml:id="m-89c5b332-d029-4f75-9371-5f8f2fdc2b90" ulx="500" uly="1477" lrx="944" lry="1515" /><zone xml:id="m-02eb0e3f-ca1f-4235-aeba-afd36e4a2198" ulx="50" uly="1480" lrx="495" lry="1515" /><zone xml:id="m-e667d34e-c2e9-4545-b106-8eeaa05304a3" ulx="502" uly="1504" lrx="941" lry="1540" /><zone xml:id="m-19054d33-aca5-4b29-a0c9-1f65bb496206" ulx="51" uly="1507" lrx="491" lry="1546" /><zone xml:id="m-b04b1c3b-f55b-4439-b518-aaeaf937c3d0" ulx="502" uly="1531" lrx="930" lry="1577" /><zone xml:id="m-9161bc57-146b-4d26-a147-4da29407c100" ulx="52" uly="1534" lrx="495" lry="1570" /><zone xml:id="m-3348707e-a9f2-4537-926e-68b2470c97b6" ulx="827" uly="1558" lrx="918" lry="1596" /><zone xml:id="m-fc58accd-a9bc-4199-a2ff-f304c0babd89" ulx="53" uly="1563" lrx="493" lry="1604" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-4aa2d389-595e-4402-8258-1c26326662dd" n="1867" facs="#m-ad07f370-d714-443d-99f7-e9ff461cd82e" /><div xml:id="m-8528b792-9cb8-411e-8a9f-f90a5704c91b">
            <lg xml:id="m-4e531f22-8515-4de2-b5b5-26bc26acf87b">
              <l xml:id="m-184ca4b8-9c97-4feb-8f35-96adebb5632b" facs="#m-6b6b08f4-ed8c-490b-8265-b32627e97354" label="ambiguous">1620</l><l xml:id="m-13466899-f9fd-45f4-983a-f2c741585bc7" facs="#m-f2d588d7-d98e-49e6-8e6f-a2205a427459" label="ambiguous">September 14.</l><l xml:id="m-7b5316d3-fb7b-44d7-a6f8-29f85aae41fc" facs="#m-fcdd2f14-6331-4346-8348-5e44fa4664e3" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-47a75f9e-af9f-43da-8309-a5c2e4746f25" facs="#m-2cb89b3e-6e2d-4060-b43b-50c754279335" label="lyrics-like">UA Dómine propitiatióne, et  praeséntem haec oblátio nobis pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-70a438fa-9359-435d-99ee-3406d77a9041" facs="#m-42d8605a-8268-42d6-b3be-39c5f7be1537" label="lyrics-like">1 beátae Mariae semper Virginis! ficiat prosperitátem et pacem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-1e018fde-bbf7-4d13-91e2-dc73eab56607" facs="#m-23d0af54-5d3b-4773-9dcb-e844939f6402" label="lyrics-like">intercessióne, ad perpétuam atque! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-00299205-fa8e-4db6-ac19-5426bedde6e6" facs="#m-94ccc8c6-bb6f-47bf-bbad-31cd7a1d2d68" label="lyrics-like">Preface of the B. V. M. Et te in Festivitâte. p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-b24ebfc0-3af2-4b52-90f0-9b96b9a7da84" facs="#m-f6f8a198-3a89-4d63-aeef-e524e82aaddb" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Beáta viscera. p. 1268.</l><l xml:id="m-26f721b6-9e39-4811-9214-0b54eb1e0961" facs="#m-82848c3a-2e73-4aef-95e1-981ff2375177" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d4b5ccdf-7bfb-4ffa-8a0d-ef757587d749" facs="#m-4f4f2738-18b1-40bd-800f-774af7a64593" label="lyrics-like">NUmptis Dómine salútis nostrae nos ubique prótegi, in cujus vene¬</l><l xml:id="m-e515394c-ec9b-44d5-abcc-131f82afb87a" facs="#m-9f594877-22c7-4e48-b4cd-2018e4293d4a" label="lyrics-like">O subsídiis: da quaésumus, beátae ratióne haec tuae obtúlimus maje¬</l><l xml:id="m-988eb28c-82de-4890-988a-3370504088e6" facs="#m-9a6f0bfe-218a-43a1-846a-11b0ba7da8ac" label="lyrics-like">Maríae semper Virginis patrocíniis! státi. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-587c44af-d271-4c8f-8a76-e7aa5bcd02e1" facs="#m-4e001304-e8e1-4b1f-ab24-09590ab376c0" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-a66df40a-7302-41f1-b2a7-6dcc95946acc" facs="#m-260d2f77-8330-43ea-b1d5-69450d8673d7" label="text-like">The Exaltation of the Holy Cross. Double major.</l><l xml:id="m-adb648a8-e0a3-4c14-8c2f-8e6461b3fa5a" facs="#m-98af0f4c-9fc9-499d-a3fb-7a7c43e25832" label="text-like">At First Vespers and at the Little Hours, the Office is said as</l><l xml:id="m-32be5396-b6a6-4c3e-bb5d-81df24c2680a" facs="#m-ac8771bf-79a3-475a-bf75-fec3f354af56" label="text-like">on the Feast of the Finding of the Holy Cross, May 3, p. 1453, with the</l><l xml:id="m-ce08d0b6-06a5-4c09-a29f-dac96d325f21" facs="#m-e58a20f5-f780-42b4-9c73-fef6aedde6e2" label="text-like">following exception. Alleluia is omitted at the end of the Antiphons.</l><l xml:id="m-9596d531-c7d8-42f2-a234-53d9d3509de1" facs="#m-8caf3af0-6997-4f97-8cd3-b6ac12733088" label="text-like">Versicles, and Short Responsories, except at the third Antiphon or Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-b945a69a-f848-4548-8c0b-5a462e5c1a4a" facs="#m-e7f2690a-f36a-4db9-823f-1e63b4dd03aa" label="lyrics-like">Ecce Crúcem Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-27a51cd0-4313-4ecc-8b74-aad163d0a07d" facs="#m-7e071ee3-69d7-4c1a-aee3-f5166a7f71a7" label="lyrics-like">The Hymn Vexilla Régis is sung with its customary chant and doxolosr.</l><l xml:id="m-1b57f6fd-937f-4268-bf8f-168fd3536db1" facs="#m-b0d21334-f332-431b-ac4d-3dd51062455a" label="lyrics-like">In the sixth Stanza, O Crux âve spes única, In hac triúmphi glória... is said.</l><l xml:id="m-889f7b24-5db3-4b7f-924a-87fa8116ced1" facs="#m-1a20de3a-f2d6-4193-bdc4-7b7b8192092f" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui nos hodiérna die. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-9f37089d-6dac-4503-aafc-e4f9dac1e441" facs="#m-3b641da3-39cc-4ab7-a76f-3120b2644dd3" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-d3959113-e439-4839-9b66-5de4e4994382" facs="#m-a4683b04-7e00-4deb-88c7-e061c34fff0c" label="text-like">Introit. Nos autem. p. 1454.</l><l xml:id="m-24a385a9-54df-430b-b6dc-e4e0a162bcdd" facs="#m-5eafc4e9-0e7a-4825-9e23-9d0ca79977a5" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-16ffdb10-6784-4d06-be1f-d5ff6f171221" facs="#m-3eb8bf58-f9b7-4b91-8201-93bba5175940" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos hodiérna die Exal-[terra cognóvimus, * ejus redem¬</l><l xml:id="m-62f1c8c8-0341-4c1c-b687-168ddbbc3de0" facs="#m-54931dd6-2e88-4be1-a5b6-591b582e5a21" label="lyrics-like">I tatiónis sanctae Crucis ánnua ptiónis praémia in caelo mereámur.</l><l xml:id="m-14a84cb9-606c-4f5b-8284-158a98a10bea" facs="#m-8591b87d-85a8-4236-831d-362b93c8d7a3" label="lyrics-like">solemnitáte laetíficas: t praesta ]Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f5ce3d43-52ed-4a5e-94a8-70d8fccc4600" facs="#m-ab3fc215-5de3-44c9-aaa3-4a02e9d4a318" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus; ut cujus mystérium in</l><l xml:id="m-fd703f45-3ee3-492c-907e-93f9fd6a975e" facs="#m-6f35550f-2891-42fa-843c-a17fb2b75102" label="ambiguous">Epistle. Hoc enim sentite in vobis. p. 592.</l><l xml:id="m-090180d5-395d-454e-8249-3d239311fb9f" facs="#m-8420cdcf-097a-4e3f-b052-e02e8bda285f" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Christus fáctus est. p. 669. Allelúia, allelúia. V. Dúlce</l><l xml:id="m-501e1372-a716-4a40-938c-8bdd3cbd3033" facs="#m-c2630f8f-09de-4772-ad4f-ac5bff9a59be" label="ambiguous">lignum. p. 1456.</l><l xml:id="m-35523960-3f65-40da-95f4-3154a66dda18" facs="#m-caddcc4b-f8b8-4a4b-8e17-d39cc688ddf5" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelil secundum Joannem. Joann. 12. c.</l><l xml:id="m-04a54d15-ae7f-4409-8ead-fcd10641868a" facs="#m-5f487101-e518-4e95-8e41-18930bb92c45" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus tur-] modo tu dicis: Opórtet exaltári</l><l xml:id="m-8a775220-db1c-4529-b19c-cabac55028cc" facs="#m-529e18a7-00e1-4957-af3b-98311419b569" label="lyrics-like">L bis Judacórum: Nunc judicium! Filium hóminis? quis est iste Filius</l><l xml:id="m-c9db4ff6-d75a-4d86-b4f6-14a230ebe372" facs="#m-c2d1723f-0777-4bc2-b34e-4b5e6a337fd3" label="lyrics-like">hóminis? Dixit érgo eis Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-6cdf96b5-18a6-4ecf-90aa-7f6cfcfcdd8c" facs="#m-f57a8271-a8e3-4f52-8989-1e78d1d261bb" label="ambiguous">est mundi: nunc princeps hujus</l><l xml:id="m-54d9bd53-b719-422d-8e70-125871ddcf74" facs="#m-3fe968be-47b1-4aa1-9213-2d093a458851" label="lyrics-like">Adhuc módicum lumen in võbis est.</l><l xml:id="m-6539a396-fa25-4f22-89f5-c14af48d8ce9" facs="#m-bbbc62d0-1823-441a-abdd-92e085c7dcc6" label="lyrics-like">mundi ejiciétur foras. Et ego si</l><l xml:id="m-4478157e-6985-4c36-9cb0-8379c008d67a" facs="#m-ba395343-803a-406f-8ca9-7e26366e0ef5" label="lyrics-like">Ambuláte dum lucem habétis, ut</l><l xml:id="m-7d9bc87c-97eb-47c2-906a-f2f1de88e481" facs="#m-b46274ed-eb36-4847-b003-ce59fd4ffea9" label="lyrics-like">exaltátus fúero a terra, ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-4d296f8c-1ebe-445f-b688-c38cc7dc1d1a" facs="#m-a2a9f186-c654-474e-8c49-dea89a17ea70" label="lyrics-like">traham ad meípsum. (Hoc autem</l><l xml:id="m-28ad6d4d-23be-4bf2-a8ab-e0755b062389" facs="#m-429e239b-c3af-450b-8c4e-efd780b29226" label="lyrics-like">non vos ténebrae comprehéndant;</l><l xml:id="m-0e2b0edb-ff5a-4aeb-a365-3ca9f6374ef1" facs="#m-89c5b332-d029-4f75-9371-5f8f2fdc2b90" label="lyrics-like">et qui ámbulat in ténebris, nescit</l><l xml:id="m-8e01f314-c9b8-4fef-b039-e07b2eb6db63" facs="#m-02eb0e3f-ca1f-4235-aeba-afd36e4a2198" label="lyrics-like">dicébat, signíficans qua morte esset</l><l xml:id="m-45a3be32-36a2-49d5-a9b8-2d395b40bfed" facs="#m-e667d34e-c2e9-4545-b106-8eeaa05304a3" label="lyrics-like">quo vadat. Dum lucem habétis,</l><l xml:id="m-0de30744-b1ec-449b-b57d-a2133f22ef15" facs="#m-19054d33-aca5-4b29-a0c9-1f65bb496206" label="lyrics-like">moritúrus). Respóndit ei turba:</l><l xml:id="m-18b0550b-c87c-49b9-b238-3c1e88d9044e" facs="#m-b04b1c3b-f55b-4439-b518-aaeaf937c3d0" label="lyrics-like">crédite in lucem, ut filii lucis sitis.</l><l xml:id="m-34e2c172-7283-4262-afec-e43a6f9b74ae" facs="#m-9161bc57-146b-4d26-a147-4da29407c100" label="ambiguous">Nos audivimus ex lege, quia Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-458fff67-36d2-4d65-b0fa-aff19b1c2a9f" facs="#m-3348707e-a9f2-4537-926e-68b2470c97b6" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-25166f27-b313-4dbd-9121-87d5e7a2ae3f" facs="#m-fc58accd-a9bc-4199-a2ff-f304c0babd89" label="lyrics-like">stus manet in aetérnum: et quó¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>